+$ |\n\nUsing the *last* column of the table above, we get the following picture:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14052876/assets/91e3506692c75397376f3addbcab0636bb817462eec529206ba3a62c84d901be.png)\n\nFinally, we fill in the required sign table.\n\n| $y>2$ | $+$ | $-$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $y<2$ | $-$ | $+$ |\n|  | $x<1$ | $x>1$ |" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14052876/state.json" "file_sha256" "32477fdf5e6b33fd9ddf098c73640d0846e4f52944145be064b748e4bc320dc2"} {"question" "q-326447" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14052876/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "d6654aab1c6684aea77ce060515556c098d052c432e70a442ff799a3ef4cb0f6"} {"question" "q-326447" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/select "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14052876/state.json" "file_sha256" "32477fdf5e6b33fd9ddf098c73640d0846e4f52944145be064b748e4bc320dc2"} {"question" "q-326447" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "+"] ["math" "-"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14052876/state.json" "file_sha256" "32477fdf5e6b33fd9ddf098c73640d0846e4f52944145be064b748e4bc320dc2"} {"question" "q-326447" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "+"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14052876/state.json" "file_sha256" "32477fdf5e6b33fd9ddf098c73640d0846e4f52944145be064b748e4bc320dc2"} {"question" "q-326447" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.ty